{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52107","headline":"五言春日侍宴望海应诏 · 长孙无忌","name":"五言春日侍宴望海应诏","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"灵夔振穷发，淑景丽青阳。\n千乘隐雷转，万骑俨腾骧。\n目极三山嶮，流睇百川长。\n仙湖遥蔼蔼，蜃气远苍苍。\n下物深逾广，引浊清讵伤。\n带雾含天碧，浮霞映日光。\n楼台自接影，云岛间相望。\n春波飞碣石，晓浪拂扶桑。\n喧声骋游□，旅浴恣翾翔。\n羣鸥心久狎，如何□稻粱？\n（同前）。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"长孙无忌","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_52107.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_52107","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"杂言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}